                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Loved this game when I was younger on the PS3, and still do to this day. It's very easy to learn, but pretty hard to master. It can get repetitive quickly, as long with the music despite being really good. But I love it for what it is and I'm sad that despite being in the game files, none of the DLC released on PC. This port also has an issue with blood decals not rendering properly and sometimes causing a bunch of black boxes to appear when killing zombies, which gets in the way blocking your view and can make it hard to see at times. Other than that, it's an okay game. RIP Doublsix.",
